Z||000013||88formula||07-05-2001||09:56 PM||||I don't know. I have a ton of pictures that some of you have sent me, thank you. If there are more though it can't hurt to post them. I started to get all the brackets on today and I got the engine mounted to the cradle. Tomorrow comes the hard part of figuring out were all the electronic stuff goes.<P>Can you believe this? My uncle and I carried the engine over to the cradle. Just before we got there I had to put the engine down because we had carried it about 50-feet. The work area is outside and is on a hill. I went over to the cradle as I was gasping for air and started to show my uncle the engine cradle. When I look back the F_cking engine started to ROLL down the hill. It rolled valve cover to oil pan two times before I jumped at it and caught it. It ruined the paint on the valve covers and bent the fuel line to the cold start injector. I was pretty pissed but the engine was all right. Good thing I taped all the openings up. <P>||||reg||1
